   "text": "{\"sections\":[{\"section\":\"summary\",\"body\":\"Kelvra Bio met each of its covenants on the Venture Term Loan for the period ended October 31, 2026, and the compliance certificate agrees with the bank's calculation on each. The most notable change is that the cushion on the Minimum Unrestricted Cash covenant has narrowed each month since August, to {{fact:2a3a396e-3d99-40dd-a6cd-973f9f582c1e}} in October. That pattern is consistent with ongoing cash burn. Cash of {{fact:8b2ad6fc-66e8-4b7e-bc70-62f77c422c5f}} remains above the {{fact:09128128-98ca-49cd-90bb-c8ebfa601184}} floor. No open items are awaiting a decision this period.\"},{\"section\":\"covenants\",\"body\":\"Minimum Runway was calculated at {{fact:558bd676-3f8f-4307-a30f-13c8c31ca83e}} against a required {{fact:6d63f452-4d8d-4faa-a724-5de2f39d66a1}}, a cushion of {{fact:07268eeb-79e4-4229-a3d4-93826bcff882}}. Minimum Unrestricted Cash was calculated at {{fact:8b2ad6fc-66e8-4b7e-bc70-62f77c422c5f}} against a required {{fact:09128128-98ca-49cd-90bb-c8ebfa601184}}, a cushion of {{fact:2a3a396e-3d99-40dd-a6cd-973f9f582c1e}}. Revenue to Plan was calculated at {{fact:81ea257f-a66d-4378-add5-5c1594c7d8d2}} against a required {{fact:f65ad08c-420b-429f-ba47-6e5a8c604955}}, a cushion of {{fact:c875b43b-3b81-4992-9cbc-43ce522c99c5}}. The certificate reports {{fact:40fb9ae8-13c8-4e95-ba61-835addbd2da7}}, {{fact:1b657805-2073-470f-97bf-e66035d163c4}} and {{fact:17a00ff5-b7fa-42b5-8fa0-0b7b9dd0002d}} respectively. Each matches the bank's calculation, and the certificate claims compliance on every covenant.\"},{\"section\":\"risks\",\"body\":\"A low-severity early warning signal fired. Headroom on the Minimum Unrestricted Cash covenant has fallen each month from August to October and now stands at {{fact:2a3a396e-3d99-40dd-a6cd-973f9f582c1e}}. Cash of {{fact:8b2ad6fc-66e8-4b7e-bc70-62f77c422c5f}} is still above the {{fact:09128128-98ca-49cd-90bb-c8ebfa601184}} floor, so this reads as a trend to monitor rather than a near-term breach. The August starting cushion is not among the figures available here. A reviewer may wish to confirm the monthly cash trajectory directly. No work items are open.\"}]}",
   "type": "text"
  }
